"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Klikni pro rozbalení dalších informací o **Pythonu**.\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To install Python, first check the \"Programming Language\" section on the "
"[Qiskit PyPI project page](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/) to determine "
"which Python versions are supported by the most recent release. For download"
" instructions, see the [Python Beginners "
"Guide](https://wiki.python.org/moin/BeginnersGuide/Download).\n"
msgstr ""
"Při instalaci Pythonu nejprve zkontroluj sekci „Programming Language\" na "
"[stránce projektu Qiskit na PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/), abys "
"zjistil/a, které verze Pythonu podporuje nejnovější vydání. Pokyny ke "
"stažení najdeš v [Průvodci pro začátečníky s "
"Pythonem.](https://wiki.python.org/moin/BeginnersGuide/Download)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: dropped, JSX/HTML tags differ from English: </AccordionItem>
# <AccordionItem title="Klikni pro rozbalení
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"These instructions use the standard Python distribution from [pypi.org](https://pypi.org/). However, you can use other Python distributions, such as [Anaconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/anaconda/) or [miniconda](https://docs.anaconda.com/miniconda/), along with other dependency management workflows like [Poetry](https://python-poetry.org/docs/).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: dropped, JSX/HTML tags differ from English:     - Používej
# [virtuální prostředí Pythonu](https://docs.py
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"Click to expand for more information on **virtual environments**.\">\n"
"    - Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html) to separate Qiskit from other applications.\n"
"    A Python virtual environment is an isolated space to work with Python for a specific purpose — so you can install whatever packages you wish, and set up libraries, dependencies, and so on, without affecting the \"base\" Python environment on your machine.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    One important advantage of a virtual environment is that if your Python "
"environment becomes corrupted, you can easily delete it and start over!\n"
msgstr ""
"    Jednou z důležitých výhod virtuálního prostředí je, že pokud se tvoje "
"prostředí Pythonu poruší, můžeš ho snadno smazat a začít znovu!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Choose a preferred location in which to store information about your "
"virtual environments. Typically they're stored in a directory named `.venv` "
"within each project directory.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Zvol preferované umístění, kam budeš ukládat informace o svých "
"virtuálních prostředích. Obvykle se ukládají do adresáře s názvem `.venv` "
"uvnitř každého adresáře projektu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    To set up a virtual environment, navigate to your project directory and "
"create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Abys nastavil/a virtuální prostředí, přejdi do adresáře svého projektu a"
" vytvoř minimální prostředí pouze s nainstalovaným Pythonem.\n"

